|---|---|
| `@EnableAsync` | Enable `@Async` |
| `@Async("executorName")` | Async method |
| `@EnableScheduling` | Enable `@Scheduled` |
| `@Scheduled(fixedDelay = 5000)` | Run every 5s after previous completes |
| `@Scheduled(fixedRate = 5000)` | Run every 5s regardless of previous |
| `@Scheduled(cron = "0 0 3 * * *")` | Cron expression |
| `@Scheduled(initialDelay = 10000)` | Delay before first run |

